  (descr "Gateron Low Profile (KS-27 & KS-33) style mechanical keyboard switch, through-hole soldering, single-sided mounting. Gateron Low Profile and Cherry MX Low Profile are NOT compatible. Plate cut lines: User.1=15.60mm square (cosmetic cover, all switches), User.2=14.00mm square (MX / MX Low Profile / Gateron Low Profile). Keycap: 2.00u (courtyard 38.05x19.00mm). For plate-mount stabilizers (no PCB holes needed).")
